      ],
      "text": "Development and autism:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " standardized developmental screening at the 9-, 18- and 30-month well-child visits; autism spectrum disorder screening at the 18- and 24-month visits."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
