      ],
      "text": "Substance use:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " CRAFFT (crafft.org) is a recommended tool for alcohol, tobacco and nicotine, marijuana and other substances, including opioids; with concern for substance or opioid use, consider recommending or prescribing naloxone."
